   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Hollywood candid: muted warm film, median ~133, red-dominant (82%), muted low saturation (0.25), soft warm highlights (222,215,209), rosy-neutral skin (159,119,100 / hue 19). Also a B&amp;W specialist. Best for: Behind-the-scenes and candid moments with a star-quality feel, groom prep, cocktail hours, black-tie evenings, Leica-style available-light frames. Flattering on mixed indoor light.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
